{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "对新华社的指示（一九六四年春）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n069)\n对新华社的指示\n（一九六四年春）\n你们新华社只有几千人，太少了，恐怕是世界通迅社中最小的吧！可以办得更大一些。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a806a1b3fc45c2870fde", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-069.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "d09d9c32c4a006ab7e186fb192dab82e7f4cbfe4af0421c29b1ca2e80addd42e", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "eed16315d00ee5dcfbc11d82d9332af0bec8b31569588be92bb30ed335b6021e", "text_chars": 125}
